<p>Obituaries from the funeral homes serving Ripley and Tippah County, published with their permission and left exactly as the funeral home wrote them. Arrangements, visitation and service times are maintained by the funeral home; follow the link on each notice for the most current details.</p>

{% if collections.obituaries and collections.obituaries.length %}
<ul class="obituary-list">
  {% for obit in collections.obituaries %}
  <li>
    {% if obit.data.featuredImage %}<a href="{{ obit.url }}" aria-label="{{ obit.data.title }}"><img src="{{ obit.data.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ obit.data.title }}" width="90" loading="lazy" style="height:auto;max-height:120px;object-fit:contain"></a>{% endif %}
    <a href="{{ obit.url }}">{{ obit.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="obituary-meta">{{ obit.data.funeralHome }} · {{ obit.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>No obituaries have been published yet. To submit one, email <a href="mailto:rctv19@gmail.com?subject=Obituary">rctv19@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+16628379088">(662) 837-9088</a>.</p>
{% endif %}

